    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aaa756c1f449ee5553441c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我决定要为自己的自由而跑──\n但那份自由又是为了什么呢？\n那只是我的任性吗？还是有其他理由？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b99719d466d20305ca87922ed274cb4accc3308a7cf2f98a7836a2a11fd6202",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf94678ee3f8041dc7fba626",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "善信……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b62d9eeb9e60f50d81af7cef45956ba757a1cc61bd5a87cac63f708ebe6cd7d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
