    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab988c839ee4ec93d9250352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我虽然不清楚，可是那理由──\n真的能拿来向麦昆夸耀吗？\n比得上她吗？一想到这个……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9439d39192c17fb3bdc4cb73b80435d90fc698e2227a6e1cf76c9412ee988f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c109a717029dc5c1e801904",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信的表情虽因痛苦而扭曲，\n仍靠着全力奔跑获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5674aaed77e42209219d98aecc3317bc85b047ebaafdd90d097d3ccf8d47f531",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064317.json",
      "json_path": [
