      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将光荣的盾形奖牌带回目白家的，\n是麦昆！\n只有这场比赛她无法退让！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24cf62cb77d3ab80e9e12c4e87bad2553e17007141508fdd4813d7fcdb7e189",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
